If our previous agreement that "the function that performs the transformation is responsible for adjusting lp" is still operative, then cov_matrix_constrain() should be responsible for adjusting lp due to

A. mapping of unbounded parameters to canonical partial correlations on (-1,1)
B. mapping of unbounded parameters to positive standard deviations

