Urgh. I meant to say that v was an Array of vars. But that should work, which is to say that we can fool Eigen into thinking that an Array of vars is close enough to an Array of doubles for it to proceed, but we have not yet fooled Eigen into aligning things in an acceptable way for matrix ops that involve gebp_traits.

