It would be better if Eigen implemented genuine mixed type operations. For example, it might be somewhat useful for us to post-multiply a matrix of ints by a vector of double-precision parameters. But I doubt Eigen would be happy with my hacks, which are really just a way to implement mixed type operations between doubles and glorified doubles.

Ben

